{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000021468","bookName":"Crie a la hija de su amante (Doblado)","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000021468/42000021468.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":3342894,"followCount":76642,"introduction":"Hace ocho años, Maira quedó incapaz de concebir tras salvar la vida de Saúl, su novio universitario y futuro esposo. Ocultando su identidad como heredera del Grupo Poder, siguió a su lado. Cuando Saúl propuso adoptar una niña, Maira crió y amó a Ana durante siete años como si fuera su propia hija. Pero todo se derrumbó al descubrir que su matrimonio era una mentira: Ana era en realidad la hija biológica de Saúl y Clara, la mujer con la que él la había traicionado...","chapterCount":60,"labels":["Strong Female Lead","Revenge"],"tags":["Strong Female Lead","Revenge"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Crie-a-la-hija-de-su-amante-Doblado","bookNameLower":"crie-a-la-hija-de-su-amante-doblado","shelfTime":"2026-07-21 11:37:32","firstShelfTime":"2026-07-21 11:37:32","performerList":[{"performerId":"29417","performerName":"Han Bo-reum","performerFormatName":"Han-Bo-reum","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/7x1/29417/29417.jpg?time=1785921284093","videoCount":2},{"performerId":"29520","performerName":"Ko Yoon","performerFormatName":"Ko-Yoon","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/0x2/29520/29520.jpg?time=1785921284106","videoCount":2}],"performerIdList":[29417,29520]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701327372","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/27/8x6/86x4/864x1/86412000024/701327372_1/701327372.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=CWOQBGZjak~EsRi3q8FZixFYI2cr8w~p8GY-nmNVGiwoAug9MBtNNBah40014DGwuFq2cTAxmzE9WQLnxdXzo6OlOIn9PEWAOmk880JEYyxGqLbkiC~J~oT2PZWRJSV5TA7Y4A